			"notes": "### Test build that may solve issue #46\n\nOn some systems people can see the wake effects through walls. It is likely a hardware related issue as it doesn't occur for me. A similar problem does, however, happen on some shaders (MakeUp UltraFast for example). I was able to reproduce the issue with this shader enabled and was able to resolve the issue. My hope is that this fix will resolve the original issue as well.\n\nJust switch out the Wakes version you already had with this one, join a world, open the config menu (with yacl, or include the wakes.json config file attached) and change the option \"Enable depth test\" in the debug tab.\n\nPlease report any observations back to the original issue (#46)."
		},
