			"notes": "### Test build to determine the cause of issue #14.\n\nDark wakes only appear on some systems. If wakes appear dark on your computer in version 0.2.0 please install this version and do the following:\n- Type the command `/wakes_debug light` in direct sunlight and underground\n- Type the command `/wakes_debug color` in a normal ocean and a luke warm ocean\n- Try the different render types found in the wakes config screen (YACL and ModMenu required)\n\nWhen done, report back to issue #14 the values printed into chat and whether or not the render types did any difference for you.\n\nTo make things simple you can copy the following template and insert the values you got:\n\n```\nDirect sunlight: <number>\nUnderground: <number>\nOcean: <r,g,b>\nLuke Warm: <r,g,b>\nRender type: <type/none>\n```"
		},
